Gramática

    0 $accept: START END

    1 START: MAIN
    2      | LIST_FUNC MAIN

    3 LIST_FUNC: LIST_FUNC FUNCTION
    4          | FUNCTION

    5 FUNCTION: TYPES ID PARA FUNC_LIST PARC LLAVA LIST_INST LLAVC
    6         | TYPES ID PARA PARC LLAVA LIST_INST LLAVC

    7 FUNC_LIST: FUNC_LIST ',' TYPES ID
    8          | TYPES ID

    9 MAIN: VOID RMAIN PARA PARC LLAVA LIST_INST LLAVC

   10 LIST_INST: LIST_INST INSTRUCTION
   11          | INSTRUCTION

   12 INSTRUCTION: PRINT ';'
   13            | DECLARATION ';'
   14            | IF
   15            | STRUCT_DECLARATION
   16            | STRUCT_CREATION
   17            | CALL_INST
   18            | RETURN ';'

   19 RETURN: RRETURN EXP
   20       | RRETURN

   21 PRINT: PRINTF PARA EXP PARC

   22 DECLARATION: TYPES ID '=' EXP

   23 IF: RIF EXP LLAVA LIST_INST LLAVC ELSEIF_LIST ELSE
   24   | RIF EXP LLAVA LIST_INST LLAVC ELSE

   25 ELSEIF_LIST: ELSEIF_LIST ELSEIF
   26            | ELSEIF

   27 ELSEIF: RELSE RIF EXP LLAVA LIST_INST LLAVC

   28 ELSE: RELSE LLAVA LIST_INST LLAVC
   29     | ε

   30 STRUCT_DECLARATION: STRUCT ID LLAVA DEC_LIST LLAVC

   31 DEC_LIST: DEC_LIST TYPES ID ';'
   32         | TYPES ID ';'

   33 STRUCT_CREATION: STRUCT ID ID '=' LLAVA EXP_LIST LLAVC

   34 EXP_LIST: EXP_LIST ',' EXP
   35         | EXP

   36 TYPES: INT
   37      | TSTRING
   38      | BOOLEAN
   39      | TSFLOAT
   40      | VOID
   41      | ARRAY

   42 EXP: EXP SUMA EXP
   43    | EXP MENOS EXP
   44    | EXP POR EXP
   45    | EXP DIV EXP
   46    | EXP MODULO EXP
   47    | EXP MEN EXP
   48    | EXP MAY EXP
   49    | EXP MEN_IG EXP
   50    | EXP MAY_IG EXP
   51    | EXP DIF EXP
   52    | EXP IG EXP
   53    | EXP AND EXP
   54    | EXP OR EXP
   55    | PARA EXP PARC
   56    | LLAVA EXP_LIST LLAVC
   57    | CALL_EXP
   58    | PRIMITIVE
   59    | ID INCREMENTO
   60    | MENOS EXP

   61 PRIMITIVE: NUMERO
   62          | STRING
   63          | BOOL
   64          | LIST_ARR
   65          | DECIMAL

   66 BOOL: RTRUE
   67     | RFALSE

   68 LIST_ARR: LIST_ARR CORA EXP CORC
   69         | LIST_ARR '.' ID
   70         | ID

   71 CALL_EXP: ID PARA EXP_LIST PARC
   72         | ID PARA PARC

   73 CALL_INST: ID PARA EXP_LIST PARC ';'
   74          | ID PARA PARC ';'


